<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sool</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Sool is an administrative region in northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/somalia">Somalia</a>, with its capital at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/las-anod">Las Anod</a>. Lying within the borders of former British <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-somaliland">Somaliland</a>, it is claimed by Somaliland and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/puntland">Puntland</a>, and much of its <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dhulbahante">Dhulbahante</a> population rejects Somaliland's rule. Somaliland lost control of much of the region after the fighting around Las Anod in 2023.</p></div>
